flowchart LR
  User[Challenge operator] --> UI[Vite React UI]
  UI --> API[FastAPI /api/search routes]

  subgraph Backend[BoldSearch modular monolith]
    API --> Router[Router and Pydantic schemas]
    Router --> Search[Search workflow]
    Router --> Submission[Local submission payloads]
    Search --> Encoder[FG-CLIP encoder]
    Search --> Milvus[Zilliz/Milvus hybrid search]
    Search --> Objects[In-memory detection index]
  end

  Objects --> CSV[(detections.csv)]
  UI --> Media[Static keyframes and frame maps]

  subgraph Planned[Validated evolution]
    Artifact[Versioned embedding artifact] --> Benchmark[Retrieval benchmark]
    Benchmark --> Decision[Provider decision]
    Search -. isolate provider calls .-> Adapter[Milvus adapter]
    Media -. serve separately .-> StaticHost[Static media host]
  end
